  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "For a **hotel conversion in Mexico**, owners commonly consider **soft brands** and **conversion-friendly brands** such as **Autograph Collection**, **The Luxury Collection**, **Delta Hotels by Marriott**, **Tapestry Collection by Hilton**, **voco hotels**, **Garner hotels**, **Noted Collection**, and **Trademark Collection Hotels**.[1][2][4][6][8][16]\n\nMore specifically:\n\n- **Marriott**: **Autograph Collection**, **The Luxury Collection**, and **Delta Hotels by Marriott** are highlighted as conversion-friendly options.[1]\n- **Hilton**: **Tapestry Collection by Hilton** has been used for conversions in Mexico.[6][11]\n- **IHG**: **voco hotels** is positioned as an upscale conversion brand, and **Garner hotels** is a midscale conversion brand now present in Mexico.[2][3][4][8][14]\n- **Wyndham**: **Trademark Collection Hotels**, **Registry Collection Hotels**, and **Dolce Hotels and Resorts** are described as soft-brand options for distinctive hotels.[16]\n\nIf you want, I can also narrow this to the **most common brands by segment** (luxury, upscale, midscale) or to the **best-fit brands for all-inclusive resorts in Mexico**.",
